---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { profilePageSchema } from '../lib/schema';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About MD Anik Hasan | Founder and Software Builder"
  description="I'm a Computer Science and Engineering student at UIU. I build websites, software and Boilabin."
  schema={profilePageSchema()}
>
  <section class="about-composition" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <h1 id="about-title">About</h1>
    <article class="prose about-story">
      <p class="about-label">Hey.</p>
      <p class="about-lead">I make websites and software. Right now I'm also building a language model.</p>

      <p class="studio-bengali" lang="bn">আমার সব project <a href="/work/">showcase section</a>-এ আছে। <span lang="en">If you want, you can see for yourself.</span></p>
      <p>
        I'm the sole founder of Boilabin. If you want to see how I'm starting my own platform, keep in touch.
      </p>
      <p>
        Salty Steak is an AI workspace that runs on my own computer. I'm building the model tools, the training setup and the desktop app myself. It's not finished yet. I'm also fine-tuning a 27B model for my own harness.
      </p>

      <p>
        I like projects where I get to learn something new. If you have one, message me.
      </p>

      <p>
        <a href="/contact/">Get in touch ↗</a>
      </p>

    </article>
  </section>
  <section class="about-details" aria-label="Profile summary">
    <aside class="content-rail">
      <div>
        <p class="rail-label">Studying</p>
        <p>Computer Science and Engineering at UIU</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="rail-label">Currently building</p>
        <p>Boilabin, SoctuKit, UIU Discord Bot, and Salty Steak</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
